1. Check Whether a Year is a Leap Year
Pseudocode:
START

Input year

IF year is divisible by 400 THEN
    Print "Leap Year"
ELSE IF year is divisible by 100 THEN
    Print "Not a Leap Year"
ELSE IF year is divisible by 4 THEN
    Print "Leap Year"
ELSE
    Print "Not a Leap Year"
END IF

STOP
